          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="contact[help]" value="A new website" data-auto><span class="opt__i" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Een nieuwe website">A new website</span><small data-nl="We beginnen bij nul.">We start from zero.</small></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="contact[help]" value="Redesign my website" data-auto><span class="opt__i" aria-hidden="true">↻</span><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Mijn site vernieuwen">Redesign my site</span><small data-nl="Hij werkt, maar voelt oud.">It works, but feels old.</small></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="contact[help]" value="Bookings, orders or a menu online" data-auto><span class="opt__i" aria-hidden="true">☰</span><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Reserveren, bestellen of menu">Bookings, orders or menu</span><small data-nl="Klanten moeten het online kunnen.">Customers should do it online.</small></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="contact[help]" value="Get found on Google" data-auto><span class="opt__i" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Gevonden worden op Google">Get found on Google</span><small data-nl="Meer mensen die je vinden.">More people finding you.</small></label>
          <label class="opt opt--wide"><input type="radio" name="contact[help]" value="Something else" data-other="f-help-x"><span class="opt__i" aria-hidden="true">…</span><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Iets anders">Something else</span><small data-nl="Vertel het ons in je eigen woorden.">Tell us in your own words.</small></label>
        </div>
        <div class="fld fld--x" hidden data-x="f-help-x">
          <input name="contact[help_other]" id="f-help-x" maxlength="140" placeholder=" ">
          <label for="f-help-x" data-nl="Waar denk je aan?">What do you have in mind?</label>
        </div>
        <span class="fld__err opts__err" id="e-1" role="alert"></span>
        <div class="ask__row">
          <span class="ask__hint mono"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span data-nl="Gratis · Vrijblijvend">Free · No obligation</span></span>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--coral" data-next><span data-nl="Volgende">Next</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pane" data-pane="2" hidden>
        <h2 class="ask__h" id="ask-h2" data-nl="Wat voor <em>zaak heb je?</em>">What kind of <em>business?</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-nl="We bouwen voor cafés en restaurants. Heb je iets anders? Vertel het ons gerust.">We build for cafés and restaurants. Running something else? Tell us anyway.</p>
        <div class="opts opts--2x" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="ask-h2">
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[business_type]" value="Café" data-auto><span class="opt__t">Café</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[business_type]" value="Restaurant" data-auto><span class="opt__t">Restaurant</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[business_type]" value="Bakery" data-auto><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Bakkerij">Bakery</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[business_type]" value="Bar" data-auto><span class="opt__t">Bar</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm opt--wide"><input type="radio" name="contact[business_type]" value="Other" data-other="f-type-x"><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Iets anders">Something else</span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="fld fld--x" hidden data-x="f-type-x">
          <input name="contact[business_type_other]" id="f-type-x" maxlength="80" placeholder=" ">
          <label for="f-type-x" data-nl="Wat voor zaak?">What kind of business?</label>
        </div>
        <span class="fld__err opts__err" id="e-2" role="alert"></span>
        <div class="ask__row">
          <button type="button" class="link mono" data-back><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span data-nl="Terug">Back</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--coral" data-next><span data-nl="Volgende">Next</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pane" data-pane="3" hidden>
        <h2 class="ask__h" id="ask-h3" data-nl="Wat moet de site <em>voor je doen?</em>">What should the site <em>do for you?</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-nl="Kies er zoveel als je wilt.">Pick as many as you like.</p>
        <div class="opts opts--chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="ask-h3">
          <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="More people walking in" data-goal><span data-nl="Meer mensen binnen">More people walking in</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="More bookings or orders" data-goal><span data-nl="Meer reserveringen of bestellingen">More bookings or orders</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="Look as good online as we are in real life" data-goal><span data-nl="Online net zo goed als in het echt">Look as good online as in real life</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="Show up higher on Google" data-goal><span data-nl="Hoger in Google">Show up higher on Google</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="Fewer calls and DMs with the same questions" data-goal><span data-nl="Minder dezelfde vragen via telefoon en DM">Fewer of the same questions in calls and DMs</span></label>
          <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="Reach tourists and expats" data-goal><span data-nl="Toeristen en expats bereiken">Reach tourists and expats</span></label>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[goal]" id="f-goal">
        <span class="fld__err opts__err" id="e-3" role="alert"></span>
        <div class="ask__row">
          <button type="button" class="link mono" data-back><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span data-nl="Terug">Back</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--coral" data-next><span data-nl="Volgende">Next</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pane" data-pane="4" hidden>
        <h2 class="ask__h" id="ask-h4" data-nl="Wanneer, en <em>welke optie?</em>">When, and <em>which option?</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-nl="Nergens aan vast. Zo weten we hoe we je preview plannen.">No commitment. It just helps us plan your preview.</p>
        <p class="grp__l mono" id="ask-g1" data-nl="Wanneer wil je live?">When do you want it live?</p>
        <div class="opts opts--2x" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="ask-g1">
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[timing]" value="As soon as possible" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Zo snel mogelijk">As soon as possible</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[timing]" value="Within a month" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Binnen een maand">Within a month</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[timing]" value="In 1–3 months" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Over 1–3 maanden">In 1–3 months</span></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[timing]" value="Just looking" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Ik kijk nog even">Just looking</span></label>
        </div>
        <p class="grp__l mono" id="ask-g2" data-nl="Welke optie past?">Which option fits?</p>
        <div class="opts opts--2x" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="ask-g2">
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[option]" value="Signature" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Signature">Signature</span><small data-nl="€3.900 + €149 p/m">€3,900 + €149/mo</small></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[option]" value="Standard" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Standaard">Standard</span><small data-nl="€995 + €39 p/m">€995 + €39/mo</small></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[option]" value="Monthly" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Per maand">Monthly</span><small data-nl="€0 + €129 p/m">€0 + €129/mo</small></label>
          <label class="opt opt--sm"><input type="radio" name="contact[option]" value="Not sure yet" data-pair><span class="opt__t" data-nl="Weet ik nog niet">Not sure yet</span><small data-nl="Dat bespreken we">Let’s talk</small></label>
        </div>
        <span class="fld__err opts__err" id="e-4" role="alert"></span>
        <div class="ask__row">
          <button type="button" class="link mono" data-back><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span data-nl="Terug">Back</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--coral" data-next><span data-nl="Volgende">Next</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pane" data-pane="5" hidden>
        <h2 class="ask__h" id="ask-h5" data-nl="Hoe heet <em>je zaak?</em>">What’s your <em>business called?</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-nl="Dan kijken we alvast rond: je Google-profiel, je Instagram, je huidige site.">So we can look around first: your Google profile, your Instagram, your current site.</p>
        <div class="fld">
          <input name="contact[business]" id="f-rest" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="80" placeholder=" " aria-required="true" aria-describedby="e-rest">
          <label for="f-rest" data-nl="Naam van je zaak">Business name</label>
          <span class="fld__err" id="e-rest" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fld">
          <input name="contact[neighbourhood]" id="f-area" maxlength="60" placeholder=" ">
          <label for="f-area"><span data-nl="Buurt of stad">Neighbourhood or city</span> <i data-nl="(optioneel)">(optional)</i></label>
        </div>
        <div class="fld">
          <input name="contact[current_site]" id="f-site" maxlength="160" placeholder=" " autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
          <label for="f-site"><span data-nl="Huidige website of Instagram">Current website or Instagram</span> <i data-nl="(optioneel)">(optional)</i></label>
        </div>
        <div class="ask__row">
          <button type="button" class="link mono" data-back><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span data-nl="Terug">Back</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--coral" data-next><span data-nl="Volgende">Next</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pane" data-pane="6" hidden>
        <h2 class="ask__h" id="ask-h6" data-nl="Waar sturen we <em>hem heen?</em>">Where do we <em>send it?</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-nl="Laatste stap. We sturen je de link zodra je concept klaar is.">Last step. We’ll send you the link when your concept is ready.</p>
        <p class="ask__p ask__err" data-err-msg role="alert" hidden></p>
        <div class="fld">
          <input name="contact[name]" id="f-name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="60" placeholder=" " aria-required="true" aria-describedby="e-name">
          <label for="f-name" data-nl="Je naam">Your name</label>
          <span class="fld__err" id="e-name" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fld">
          <input type="email" name="contact[email]" id="f-email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="120" placeholder=" " aria-required="true" aria-describedby="e-email">
          <label for="f-email" data-nl="E-mail">Email</label>
          <span class="fld__err" id="e-email" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fld">
          <input type="tel" name="contact[phone]" id="f-phone" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="30" placeholder=" ">
          <label for="f-phone"><span data-nl="WhatsApp / telefoon">WhatsApp / phone</span> <i data-nl="(optioneel)">(optional)</i></label>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[phone_test_score]" id="f-pt-score">
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[phone_test_fails]" id="f-pt-fails">
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[body]" id="f-body">
        <div class="ask__row">
          <button type="button" class="link mono" data-back><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> <span data-nl="Terug">Back</span></button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--coral"><span data-nl="Laat mijn site zien">Show me my site</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="fine ask__fine" data-nl="We gebruiken dit alleen om je je concept te sturen. <a href='https://dolcessi.com/policies/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a>">We only use this to send you your concept. <a href="https://dolcessi.com/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="pane" data-pane="8" hidden>
        <h2 class="ask__h" id="ask-h8" data-nl="Laat je nummer achter. <em>Wij appen jou.</em>">Leave your number. <em>We’ll WhatsApp you.</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-nl="Binnen 24 uur krijg je een appje van ons. Geen belletjes, geen spam.">You’ll get a WhatsApp from us within 24 hours. No calls, no spam.</p>
        <p class="ask__p ask__err" data-wa-err role="alert" hidden></p>
        <div class="fld">
          <input type="tel" id="f-wa" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" maxlength="30" placeholder=" " aria-required="true" aria-describedby="e-wa">
          <label for="f-wa" data-nl="Je WhatsApp-nummer">Your WhatsApp number</label>
          <span class="fld__err" id="e-wa" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fld">
          <input id="f-wa-rest" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="80" placeholder=" " aria-required="true" aria-describedby="e-wa-rest">
          <label for="f-wa-rest" data-nl="Naam van je zaak">Business name</label>
          <span class="fld__err" id="e-wa-rest" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="fld">
          <input type="email" id="f-wa-email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="120" placeholder=" " aria-required="true" aria-describedby="e-wa-email">
          <label for="f-wa-email"><span data-nl="E-mail">Email</span> <i data-nl="(als reserve)">(as a backup)</i></label>
          <span class="fld__err" id="e-wa-email" role="alert"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="ask__row">
          <button type="button" class="link mono" data-close><span data-nl="Niet nu">Not now</span></button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn--coral" data-wa-send><span data-nl="App mij">WhatsApp me</span><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="fine ask__fine" data-nl="We gebruiken je nummer alleen om je over je site te appen. <a href='https://dolcessi.com/policies/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a>">We only use your number to message you about your site. <a href="https://dolcessi.com/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="pane pane--done" data-pane="7" hidden>
        <span class="done__tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22"/><path d="M14 24.5l7 7 13-14"/></svg></span>
        <h2 class="ask__h ask__h--big" id="ask-h7" data-done="flow" data-nl="De bon is binnen. <em>Je site staat op het vuur.</em>">Ticket’s in. <em>Your site’s on the stove.</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-done="flow" data-nl="We gaan aan de slag en mailen je zodra hij klaar is. Vragen? <a href='mailto:info@dolcessi.com' data-cursor='HI'>info@dolcessi.com</a>">We’re on it, and we’ll email you when it’s ready. Questions? <a href="mailto:info@dolcessi.com" data-cursor="HI">info@dolcessi.com</a></p>
        <h2 class="ask__h ask__h--big" id="ask-h7w" data-done="wa" data-nl="Staat genoteerd. <em>Hou je WhatsApp in de gaten.</em>">Got it. <em>Watch your WhatsApp.</em></h2>
        <p class="ask__p" data-done="wa" data-nl="We appen je binnen 24 uur. Liever mailen? <a href='mailto:info@dolcessi.com' data-cursor='HI'>info@dolcessi.com</a>">We’ll message you within 24 hours. Rather email? <a href="mailto:info@dolcessi.com" data-cursor="HI">info@dolcessi.com</a></p>
        <div class="ask__row"><span></span><button type="button" class="btn btn--cream" data-close><span data-nl="Terug naar de site">Back to the site</span></button></div>
      </div>
      </div>
    {% endform %}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"><i class="cursor__dot"></i><i class="cursor__ring"><span class="cursor__lbl"></span></i></div>
<noscript><style>.pre{display:none}</style></noscript>
<script>(function(){var d=document,h=d.documentElement;if(!h.classList.contains('is-nl'))return;var a=d.querySelectorAll('[data-nl]'),i,e;for(i=0;i<a.length;i++){e=a[i];e._en=e.innerHTML;e.innerHTML=e.getAttribute('data-nl')}['aria-label','alt','placeholder','title','href'].forEach(function(k){var b=d.querySelectorAll('[data-nl-'+k+']');for(i=0;i<b.length;i++){e=b[i];e._enA=e._enA||{};e._enA[k]=e.getAttribute(k)||'';e.setAttribute(k,e.getAttribute('data-nl-'+k))}})})()</script>
